# Rules Self-Check

## Responsibility

Check compliance with all rules in thinking.

## Check Timing

Before each operation, when potential violation detected, when user points out issue.

## Violation Handling

1. Acknowledge violation in thinking
2. State which rule was violated
3. Correct error
4. Re-execute

**Principle: Rules exist to be followed.**
